      about: "The run rate is $782.72 a week, $1,238.72 less the $456.00 clamp project. Per good barrel it is about 4 cents at every station, small next to labour, which is normal: maintenance matters to cost through the downtime it prevents, not through its own spend. The Maintenance track divided by all barrels made ($0.0604); this track divides by good barrels and leaves out the project, so the two figures answer different questions.",
